{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25937","headline":"长城 · 鲍溶","name":"长城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒙公虏生人，北筑秦氏冤。\n祸兴萧墙内，万里防祸根。\n城成六国亡，宫阙启千门。\n生人半爲土，何用空中原。\n奈何家天下，骨肉尚无恩。\n投沙拥海水，安得久不翻。\n乘高惨人魂，寒日易黄昏。\n枯骨贯朽铁，砂中如有言。\n万古骊山下，徒悲野火燔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}